[
  {
    "id": "housing.buy.viewing",
    "domain": "housing",
    "seed": "看房",
    "type": "daily",
    "age": [
      24,
      34
    ],
    "when": {
      "not_flags": [
        "owns_home"
      ],
      "stat": {
        "home_afford": ">=0.6"
      }
    },
    "weight": 2,
    "text": [
      {
        "t": "周末你跟着中介看了五个楼盘，样板间都很好看。"
      },
      {
        "t": "售楼处的沙盘前，销售说这里\"三年后通地铁\"。"
      },
      {
        "t": "中介说现在是买方市场，你可以慢慢挑。",
        "when": {
          "scenario": "property_slump"
        }
      },
      {
        "t": "开盘那天售楼处排起了长队，有人在门口打地铺。",
        "when": {
          "scenario": "property_boom"
        }
      }
    ],
    "cooldown": 2
  },
  {
    "id": "housing.buy.decide",
    "domain": "housing",
    "seed": "买房",
    "type": "choice",
    "age": [
      24,
      34
    ],
    "when": {
      "not_flags": [
        "owns_home",
        "renter_by_choice"
      ],
      "stat": {
        "home_afford": ">=1"
      }
    },
    "chance": "0.22 + 0.3*flag(\"wants_home\") + 0.2*flag(\"married\")",
    "cooldown": 1,
    "text": [
      {
        "t": "存款加上家里能给的，第一次够上了首付。"
      },
      {
        "t": "你把首付、税费和装修钱列在一张纸上，最后一行刚好是正数。"
      },
      {
        "t": "身边的人都在说\"再不买就上不了车了\"。",
        "when": {
          "scenario": "property_boom"
        }
      },
      {
        "t": "房价跌了两年，中介说现在是\"底部\"，去年他也这么说。",
        "when": {
          "scenario": "property_slump"
        }
      }
    ],
    "fact": {
      "text": "2024 年 9 月底起，全国首套房最低首付比例统一为 15%",
      "source": "pboc_downpay_2024",
      "year": 2024
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "买",
        "hint": "首付掏空存款，背上 30 年房贷",
        "effects": {
          "buy_home": "city",
          "mood": 5,
          "flags_remove": [
            "wants_home"
          ]
        },
        "followups": [
          {
            "id": "housing.buy.sign",
            "delay": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "family.parents.downpay",
            "delay": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "housing.big.stock_down",
            "delay": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "housing.buy.keys",
            "delay": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "再等等",
        "hint": "也许明年价格更合适",
        "effects": {
          "mood": -1
        }
      },
      {
        "label": "不买了",
        "hint": "租房也是一种活法",
        "effects": {
          "mood": 2,
          "flags_add": [
            "renter_by_choice"
          ]
        },
        "auto": 0.4
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "housing.buy.hometown",
    "domain": "housing",
    "seed": "回老家买房",
    "type": "choice",
    "age": [
      25,
      34
    ],
    "when": {
      "city_tier": "<=2",
      "not_flags": [
        "owns_home"
      ],
      "stat": {
        "home_afford": "<1",
        "hometown_afford": ">=1"
      }
    },
    "chance": 0.15,
    "cooldown": 2,
    "text": [
      {
        "t": "在这里买不起，同样的钱在老家能买一套三居室。"
      },
      {
        "t": "母亲发来老家新楼盘的照片，说\"给你留个窝\"。"
      }
    ],
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "在老家买一套",
        "hint": "钱够了，人却不在那儿",
        "effects": {
          "buy_home": "hometown",
          "mood": 2
        },
        "followups": [
          {
            "id": "housing.buy.sign",
            "delay": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "family.parents.downpay",
            "delay": 0
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "不买",
        "hint": "钱留在手里",
        "effects": {
          "mood": -1
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "housing.buy.sign",
    "domain": "housing",
    "seed": "签合同",
    "type": "milestone",
    "age": [
      22,
      35
    ],
    "trigger": "follow",
    "text": [
      {
        "t": "签了 30 年的贷款合同，你签名的时候手在抖。"
      },
      {
        "t": "银行的人说\"在这里、这里、还有这里签字\"，你一共签了 47 次。"
      },
      {
        "t": "你在老家的房产证上写了自己的名字，然后坐高铁回去上班。",
        "when": {
          "flags": [
            "hometown_home"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
